   "scene_type": "data_flow",
   "duration_hint": 13,
   "spoken": "The NIS2 Directive sets a unified framework for cybersecurity in 18 critical sectors across the EU. According to the European Commission, as a rule medium-sized and large entities in these sectors must manage risks and report significant incidents.",
